+(def ^:dynamic ^:private *final-tags*
+  "While a batch is resolved, a map from the db id of each existing entity the batch tags to the tag
+  entities it holds once the whole batch has applied (final-tags), else nil. A class check judges
+  such an entity by these tags, so a tag another entry gives it counts whatever the entry order,
+  and a tag a reset list in the batch removes doesn't."
